<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main class="wrap-narrow">
  <h1 class="auth-title" style="margin-top:12px">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="auth-sub">Buffalo Jumpstart · Buffalo Investment Agency</p>
  <div class="card stack">
    <p>Buffalo Jumpstart is the internal training portal of Buffalo Investment Agency. It is used only by the agency's advisers and administrators.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Your name, adviser code, email address, mobile number and upline, which you or an administrator enter when your account is created. We also record your training progress: videos watched, quiz results, workshop and Zoom attendance, and the dates of these activities.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To run your training: unlocking modules, issuing your certificate, showing your progress to agency administrators and to your upline, and sending you account and training emails (approval, password links and reminders).</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>The portal sends these emails through the agency's own Gmail account using Google's Gmail API. It only has permission to send email. It does not read, store or share anyone's mailbox, and Google user data is not used for any other purpose or shared with anyone else.</p>
    <h2>Sharing and storage</h2>
    <p>Your information is not sold or shared outside Buffalo Investment Agency. It is stored on our hosting provider (Railway) in Singapore and is kept for the agency's training records. Deactivated accounts keep their training history.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>To correct or remove your information, contact the agency at <a href="mailto:buffaloinvestmentagency@gmail.com">buffaloinvestmentagency@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <a class="small" href="/login">Back to log in</a>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
